      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To begin the process, start with Password Verification, followed by Verifiy Password."
      ],
      "justification": "Initiates the process and models the two sequential verification steps described in the opening unit."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "branch:b1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If you choose \"Select Cancel\", you will be directed to iforgot.apple.com.",
        "However, if you select \"Reset password\", you will be automatically directed to iforgot.apple.com.",
        "In case you choose \"Retry\", you will need to re-enter your password."
      ],
      "justification": "Structural XOR split corresponding to the three distinct user choices presented in the text."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n5",
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If you choose \"Select Cancel\", you will be directed to iforgot.apple.com."
      ],
      "justification": "Accurately captures the 'Select Cancel' condition and the resulting navigation action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n6",
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if you select \"Reset password\", you will be automatically directed to iforgot.apple.com."
      ],
      "justification": "Accurately captures the 'Reset password' condition and the resulting navigation action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n7",
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "In case you choose \"Retry\", you will need to re-enter your password."
      ],
      "justification": "Accurately captures the 'Retry' condition and the password re-entry action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "converge:c1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After that, go to iforgot.apple.com and proceed with Reset Password."
      ],
      "justification": "Structural join merging the decision branches before continuing. Structural elements do not require direct textual backing but align with flow progression."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8",
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After that, go to iforgot.apple.com and proceed with Reset Password."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly models navigating to the recovery site and initiating the reset procedure."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If you need to re-enter your password, do so and then verify it."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the explicit verification step following password re-entry."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the password is reset, you can return to the iTunes purchases page."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct match to returning to the purchases page after reset."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n14"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "From there, select the price of the item."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct match to selecting the item price."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "branch:b3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If prompted to \"Enter Password\", verify the password.",
        "Alternatively, if asked to \"Enter Apple ID\", enter the password."
      ],
      "justification": "Structural XOR split corresponding to the two alternative prompt scenarios."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
